allowed), branch `feat/...`, commit, `git push -u origin feat/...`, then `racky-pr --repo <owner>/<repo> --head feat/... --base main --title \\\"...\\\" --body-file pr.md`. Pushing to main is refused. A 403 \\\"GitHub access is off\\\" means the owner has not turned on Git from computers: journal BLOCKED.\\nTabular data: when you collect it, define a dataset with a key (dataset_define) and append rows as you go with dataset_append (batches of up to 500), passing `_request_id` from reqlog_query for each row's source page. Don't hold everything until the end.\\nConduct: prefer official APIs and open data before scraping; never buy, pay, subscribe, donate or accept terms for the user; never create accounts, change account data or settings, or send messages, emails or forms that contact people (search and filter forms are fine); log in only with a profile the human authenticated or via help_request(kind=login); never bypass a login, paywall or captcha (captcha: help_request, then poll help_wait); if the task seems to need something forbidden, help_request(kind=permission) or journal BLOCKED and stop.\",\"tools\":[\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__box_claim\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__box_status\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__box_release\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__computer_mode\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_open\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_read\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_screenshot\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_click\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_type\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_press\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_select\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_scroll\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_wait\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_eval\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_cookies\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_tabs\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_back\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_forward\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_reload\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_download\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__browser_upload\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__exec\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__exec_start\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__exec_poll\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__exec_cancel\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__http_request\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__reqlog_query\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__reqlog_get\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__reqlog_as_curl\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__proxy_set\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__proxy_status\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__render\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__journal\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__timeline\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__result_submit\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__dataset_define\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__dataset_append\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__dataset_import\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__dataset_read\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__help_request\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__help_wait\",\"mcp__abx-parent-a-w2__help_cancel\"]}}"]
